OL,3,GNEWSA'One of Britain's rarest birds
OL,4,Awalked past my kitchen window'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirdwatcher and head of RSPB supporter
OL,7,Fcommunications, Luke Phillips,
OL,8,Fdescribed the urban sighting as
OL,9,F"really, really odd", but the bittern
OL,10,Flater died having been taken into the
OL,11,Fcare of a wildlife rescue.
